An optional source field copied to a required target field: an instance that
lacks it would have nothing to put there.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: string
	b: int
	c: bool
}

forward: {
	c: true
}
-- out/error --
b is optional in 0.0 and required in 1.0: map it with orelse(input.b, <fallback>), which is not supported yet:
    1.0.thema:3:2
